# macOS-specific configure options.
#
# Homebrew's lz4/zstd search paths are NOT listed here: the prefix differs
# by architecture (/opt/homebrew on Apple Silicon, /usr/local on Intel), so
# scripts/configure.sh detects it at configure time via `brew --prefix` and
# appends --with-libraries/--with-includes itself. These are build-time
# search paths only: runtime linkage is rewritten to @loader_path/../lib
# and verified to contain no Homebrew references
# (scripts/rewrite-runtime-links-darwin.sh, verify-runtime-links-darwin.sh).
